                        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 23:56:20 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Sign-in now shows kazhy.app.</b> The macOS dialog that appears when you sign in with Google or Apple used to name a long, random-looking database address &mdash; the kind of thing you should not approve. It now names <code>auth.kazhy.app</code>.</p><p>Sign-in itself is unchanged and still takes one click.</p>]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://kazhy.app/downloads/Kazhy-1.0.2.dmg"
